# Echo of Dusk ({1}{B}, 2/2): "Descend 4 - As long as there are four or more permanent cards in your graveyard, this creature gets +1/+1 and has lifelink" (CR 207.2c, 700.11, 604.1, 613.4c).
# Bot1's graveyard: Faithless Looting (a sorcery, not a permanent card) and the two Islands it discards (2 permanent cards), then a sacrificed Black Lotus (3 permanent cards; the
# Looting does not count): still a 2/2 with no keywords. Turn 2 Bot2 sacrifices its own Black Lotus and casts Lightning Bolt (a permanent card and an instant in Bot2's graveyard,
# which are not Bot1's): still 2/2. The Bolt kills Bot1's Memnite, the fourth permanent card: exactly four, so 3/3 with lifelink. On turn 3 it attacks an empty board: Bot2 takes 3
# and Bot1 gains 3.
